    "detailed_description": "Who doesn't look forward to winter as much as we do? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWell, we have a special reason why we have been preparing all year round.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJust imagine, a lot of snow, you and a supercar in front of you with rear wheel drive. I think it's every car fan's dream. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nEverything is happy and beautiful, but be very careful when performing these drifts because the cars have too much horsepower and you might end up in situations out of control. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThat's why the Drift on Snow game has prepared a special training mode for you to test different situations so that you can show a masterclass in front of your friends.Ready ?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe main game features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Some mods like practice<br />\r\n- Levels which are easy/hard<br />\r\n- Timer",
